<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei",Arial,sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>调参结果：+0.0041，真实但有限</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C7D8F2' }}>09 · Tuning</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 54 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            固定结构，只把 conv_width 由 32 改为 64，其余超参全部不动；三次独立运行给出同一方向的差值。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 34, marginTop: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 620, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Image src='assets/before_after.png' style={{ width: 610, height: 415, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 2 }}>
                    图：figures/before_after.png。纵轴自 0.92 起，柱间差值仅 0.0046，视觉放大了差距。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 506, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>+0.0041</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>三次配对的平均差值</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>19 ×</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>差值 / base 标准差</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>3 / 3</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>三个种子全部同向</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>
                    三个判据同时满足，才可以写「提升」；缺一项就只能写成敏感性观察。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

        <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>
                幅度虽小，但方向稳定；<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>这个提升只发生在 SmallCNN 内部</span>，换成全局混合结构后宽度几乎不再起作用。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>MedMNIST 医学影像分类调参实验室 · 中期验收</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>09 / 16</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
